Author: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>
Date:   Fri Sep 25 20:01:00 2026 +1000

    CI: run the magnum, NFV and CloudKitty scenarios.
    
    Kolla builds the designate, magnum, trove, tacker, mistral, barbican
    and cloudkitty images, but no job a Kolla change triggers deploys them,
    so a change that breaks them at runtime passes check. Add templates
    running the matching Kolla-Ansible scenarios when those images change.
    
    The Kolla-Ansible jobs are already non-voting, so this adds coverage
    without adding gate risk.
    
    Prompt: Michael noticed a reviewer believed magnum images were not
    built in Kolla CI, and asked which images Kolla-Ansible deploys that
    Kolla's own CI never exercises. These are the images that no Kolla
    scenario deploys.
    
    Assisted-By: Claude Code
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
    
    Change-Id: I1ef5bf13c5a3f1085eb0e07e9ff5f81cb8a25d58
